        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Superpoder. O corpo inteiro de Machop é formado por músculos. Mesmo tendo o tamanho de uma criança humana, ele consegue arremessar cem adultos. Sempre cheio de energia, passa o tempo levantando grandes pedras, o que o torna ainda mais forte.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 75% M / 25% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Machop pode evoluir para Machoke no nível 8 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Focus Energy, Leer, Low Kick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Foresight, Karate Chop</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Low Sweep, Seismic Toss</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Knock Off, Revenge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Vital Throw, Wake-Up Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Strength</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Dual Chop, Submission</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Bulk Up, Cross Chop</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Dynamic Punch, Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Double-Edge</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Bulldoze, Coaching, Confide, Dig, Double Team, Dual Chop, Earthquake, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Punch, Flamethrower, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Energy, Focus Punch, Frustration, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Knock Off, Light Screen, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Payback, Poison Jab, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Revenge, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Scary Face, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Superpower, Swagger, Thief, Thunder Punch, Toxic, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Bullet Punch, Close Combat, Counter, Encore, Fire Punch, Heavy Slam, Ice Punch, Knock Off, Meditate, Power Trick, Quick Guard, Rolling Kick, Smelling Salts, Submission, Thunder Punch, Tickle</p>",
